      "created_at": "2013-11-13T04:52:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When a hero is reduced to 0 HP and incapacitated, is that considered \"destroying\" their character card for game purposes?&nbsp; Specifically I'm thinking of Anubis's punishment damage whenever a card is destroyed.&nbsp; If no other acts of destruction happens during a turn in which is a hero being put down, does Anubis deal damage?&nbsp; If other acts do occur, but hero incapacitation is first, it might still matter when Anubis fires, for the sake of multiple \"highest HP hero\" hits possibly changing targets.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:42.117Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
