      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-11-13T08:13:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, a different Anubis question then.&nbsp; If Judgment of Anubis is played, but Anubis is neither in the deck nor the trash (for instance, he got in Haka's belly for some Savage Mana), Anubis is not in play, so presumably he can't deal 2 damage to each target?&nbsp; The Judgment doesn't have a Ra nemesis symbol (and even if it did, it wouldn't be a target and that can matter for some damage prevention sources), so I gather that the card is not authorized to deal damage on Anubis's behalf in his absence.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:04:23.359Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
