      "raw": "<p>Okay, a different Anubis question then.&nbsp; If Judgment of Anubis is played, but Anubis is neither in the deck nor the trash (for instance, he got in Haka&#39;s belly for some Savage Mana), Anubis is not in play, so presumably he can&#39;t deal 2 damage to each target?&nbsp; The Judgment doesn&#39;t have a Ra nemesis symbol (and even if it did, it wouldn&#39;t be a target and that can matter for some damage prevention sources), so I gather that the card is not authorized to deal damage on Anubis&#39;s behalf in his absence.</p>",
